; font-size:18pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Planning Commission Meeting </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">6:00 PM - Monday, November 9, 2026</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt; font-size:12pt\"><span>City Council Chambers, 500 E. 3rd Street</span></p></td></tr></table><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"-aw-import:spaces\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"-aw-import:spaces\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"-aw-import:ignore\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">Phone Option: </span><span style=\"-aw-import:spaces\">&nbsp;</span><span>Members of the public who wish to provide public comment during the public comment portion or during a specific agenda item may call the number below after 5:50 pm, at which time they will be muted and placed on hold.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"-aw-import:ignore\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\"><span>When prompted, enter the following Meeting ID, followed by the \"#\" sign: </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\"></span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\"><span>Press \"#\" when asked for the participant ID.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"-aw-import:ignore\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\"><span>To speak to an agenda item when public comment is called for, please press *9 on your phone and wait for the moderator.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span style=\"-aw-import:ignore\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:1pt\"><span style=\"f